"""The icon set of the poster highlights: Lucide (ISC licence), stroke icons.

A highlight is one icon plus one line of text ("Gezellig samen wandelen en
praten"). The unit picks the icon by code in the editor; the template draws it
as a coloured disc with the stroke paths inside, at any size, in any of the
brand colours. Paths are copied from lucide.dev, 24 × 24 viewBox.

Keep the list short and named for what it shows, not for where it is used:
the same ``calendar`` serves the highlights and the dates grid.
"""
